  "title": "Dynamics behaviour of an elastic non-ideal (NIS) portal frame, including fractional nonlinearities",
  "abstract": "This paper overviews recent developments on some problems related to elastic structures, such as portal frames, taking into account the full interactions of the vibrating systems, with an energy source of limited power supply (small motors, electro-mechanical shakers). We include a discussion on fractional (rational) damping and stiffness effects on the adopted modelling. This was a plenary lecture, delivered in the event titled: Mechanics of Slender Structures, organized in Northampton, England from 21-22, September 2015.",
